ata in Amazon Redshift, and make ongoing improvements to their games with machine learning models on Amazon SageMaker.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/warner-bros-logo%401x.e0b50fd0cad445df4c1e4f20f10b5bd6fd80d2d5.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"warner bros. entertainment","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2023-01-11","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/warner-bros-games-video-testimonial/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Warner Bros. Entertainment","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Warner Bros. Games Enhances the Player Experience Using AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_U