 their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#nielsen20200923tyuiop","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"nielsen20200923tyuiop","dateCreated":"2022-05-23T21:42:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-23T21:53:01+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Learn from Nielsen Marketing Cloud how to process 55TB of data per day while maintaining quality, performance, and cost using a fully automated serverless pipeline.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/Nielsen_Customer-Reference_Logo.d6abe0859a4fcedaac9709042b5fedfe9e0ecfde.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Digital Marketing","sortDate":"2020-09-23","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/Jkx6kVbDpL4?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Nielsen: Processing 55TB of Data Per Day with AWS Lambda","customer-name":"The Nielsen Company"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#ca