eing created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#ge-power-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"ge-power-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:58:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:05:04+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"GE Power uses data analytics on AWS to help power plant customers save millions of dollars, stream 500,000 data records per second, and scale to support the ingestion of 20 billion sensor-data tags. The company provides utilities and power companies throughout the world with solutions for power generation.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/GEPower_Customer-Reference_Logo.7100af15f7461bdc2ea9edec4f9b61e536c54f48.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eGE Power uses data analytics on AWS to help power plant customers save millions of dollars, stream 500,000 data records per second, and scale to support the ingestion of 20 billion sensor-data tags. The company provides utilities and power companies throughout the world with solutions for power generation. GE Power runs its key data-analytics application on AWS, using Amazon Kinesis Data Streams and Amazon Elastic MapReduce.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Power \u0026 Utilities","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/general-electric-power/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"GE Power","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"GE Power Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis-data-streams","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis Data Streams","description":"Amazon Kinesis Data Streams","dateCreated":"2020-05-08T03:45:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#global","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Global","description":"Global","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#power-utilities","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Power \u0026 Utilities","description":"Power \u0026 Utilities","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:08+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#energy","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Energy","description":"Energy","dateCreated":"2020-07-15T21:58:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32: