uses to AWS to conduct predictive analysis of future aviation needs, to develop and test new solutions based on those findings, and to deliver airport data to users.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/video-thumbs/icao-thumb.7829d4251ffafbd97bcf091d1d591f7ab0038ae9.PNG","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO) is a U.N. agency that develops and monitors international standards and practices for civil aviation regulations. ICAO uses AWS to conduct predictive analysis of future aviation needs, to develop and test new solutions based on those findings, and to deliver airport data to users. By using AWS, the ICAO gained greater stability, reliability, and higher performance than with its previous IT infrastructure, allowing organization staff to focus on developing its services.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2015-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/international-civil-aviation-organization-icao/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO)","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2015","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO)"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#dev-and-test","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Dev \u0026 Test","description":"Dev \u0026 Test","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-