s (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-magisto","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-magisto","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:56:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:42+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Israeli video creation and sharing service Magisto built its service on AWS so that it could launch quickly, scale to meet the needs of millions of users, and process massive amounts of videos. The company uses AWS to host its video editing tool and store and process more than 800 TB of data.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Magisto_Customer-Reference_Logo.1cbba2615b4147b3bf86423733900f766ec661ae.png","displayLocation":"Israel","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eIsraeli video creation and sharing service Magisto built its service on AWS so that it could launch quickly, scale to meet the needs of millions of users, and process massive amounts of videos. The company uses AWS to host its video editing tool and store and process more than 800 TB of data. Using AWS allowed Magisto to scale up and serve its 40 million customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/magisto/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Magisto","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: Magisto"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#middle-east-africa","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Middle East \u0